{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101340","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101340","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1310134001:0":{"text":"总算将它们处理完了……","source_cn":"总算将它们处理完了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA03E0F6A2D5B44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310134002:0":{"text":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，你和你的使魔、你的伙伴，的确实力不俗。","source_cn":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>女...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x82C494781D3D40DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，你和你的使魔、你的伙伴，的确实力不俗。","female":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，你和你的使魔、你的伙伴，的确实力不俗。","variant_male_record_index":"144569","variant_female_record_index":"144570","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310134003:0":{"text":"感谢诸位的援助，我不该怀疑你们的能力，请允许我为我之前的失礼再次道歉。","source_cn":"感谢诸位的援助，我不该怀疑你们的能力，请允许我为我之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A2FA032CCAC1006","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310134004:0":{"text":"哎呀，不必这样，你也是为了我们的安全考虑……","source_cn":"哎呀，不必这样，你也是为了我们的安全考虑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8237FFF317AE579E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310134005:0":{"text":"我本应负责雪松镇周边的安全，以应对可能会对祭典造成破坏的活死人的。","source_cn":"我本应负责雪松镇周边的安全，以应对可能会对祭典造成破坏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0C410CAA47EA384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310134006:0":{"text":"唉，今晚的事是我疏忽了……那间屋子里的朋友们……","source_cn":"唉，今晚的事是我疏忽了……那间屋子里的朋友们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B3BBD6336E3395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310134007:0":{"text":"别担心，他们都还好。我们让他们去你的小屋里休息了。","source_cn":"别担心，他们都还好。我们让他们去你的小屋里休息了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27C5EB3DA6933A2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310134008:0":{"text":"多亏诸位援手，我们先回去看看，希望那几位朋友没有受到大伤害。","source_cn":"多亏诸位援手，我们先回去看看，希望那几位朋友没有受到大伤害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE1DDAA06309EE43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"法拉莫尔","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}